{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 29, "model_name": "abacusai/dracarys-llama-3.1-70b-instruct", "content": "As I stepped off the plane in Tokyo, I couldn't help but feel a rush of excitement. I had dreamed of visiting Japan for years, and finally, I was here. The first thing that struck me was the vibrant energy of the city. Neon lights illuminated the streets, and the sounds of chatter and car horns filled the air.\n\nI spent my first few days exploring the city, marveling at the towering skyscrapers and ancient temples. I visited the famous Tsukiji Fish Market, where I sampled the freshest sushi of my life, and strolled through the beautiful Imperial Palace East Garden.\n\nFrom Tokyo, I traveled to Kyoto, a city steeped in tradition and history. I wandered through the serene gardens of the Fushimi Inari Shrine, admiring the thousands of vermilion torii gates that lined the paths. I also visited the Kinkaku-ji Temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion, which was even more breathtaking than I had imagined.\n\nAs I traveled through Japan, I was struck by the kindness and hospitality of the people. Everywhere I went, I was greeted with warm smiles and welcoming gestures. The food was also incredible, with delicious meals ranging from steaming bowls of ramen to delicate kaiseki feasts.\n\nMy trip to Japan was everything I had hoped for and more. The country's unique blend of tradition and modernity, combined with its stunning natural beauty, left me in awe. I left with a newfound appreciation for this incredible country and its people, and I couldn't wait to plan my next visit.", "logprobs": [{"token": "As", "logprob": -2.5528886318206787}, {"token": " I", "logprob": -0.001798696699552238}, {"token": " stepped", "logprob": -4.0174338209908456e-05}, {"token": " off", "logprob": -5.245222382654902e-06}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " plane", "logprob": -0.0002711782872211188}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -8.583106136939023e-06}, {"t